{"id": "t-006", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "Read the `1d` message history of Slack channel `C08L3M7P2Q` without join or leave activity to get the Confluence page ID for the on-call handoff doc, read that Confluence page to find the active Grafana incident ID, and resolve that Grafana incident.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "slack", "tool": "conversations_history", "match": {"channel_id": {"$ci": "C08L3M7P2Q"}}, "result": {"json": {"messages": [{"ts": "1763519000.001000", "user": "U04R8T2", "text": "Updated the EMEA shift notes on Confluence page 67492018."}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_get_page", "match": {"page_id": "67492018"}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"id": "67492018", "title": "EMEA Shift Handoff", "content": "Soak finished cleanly; you can now close Grafana incident inc-6614."}}}, {"id": "s3", "server": "grafana", "tool": "update_incident", "match": {"incidentId": {"$ci": "inc-6614"}, "status": {"$ci": "resolved"}}, "after": ["s2"], "result": {"json": {"id": "inc-6614", "status": "resolved"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2", "s3"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "grafana", "tool": "update_incident", "required": {"incidentId": {"$ci": "inc-6614"}, "status": {"$ci": "resolved"}}}]}
{"id": "tr-004", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "Search Terraform policies for `tag cost center enforcement` to get the verified policy ID, then create a new GitHub issue in `selvane-cloud/org-guardrails` whose title includes that policy ID.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "terraform", "tool": "search_policies", "match": {"policy_query": {"$contains": "tag cost center enforcement"}}, "result": {"json": {"policies": [{"policy_id": "pol-selvane-cost-tag-v3", "title": "Enforce Cost Center Tags", "verified": true}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "github", "tool": "issue_write", "match": {"method": {"$ci": "create"}, "owner": {"$ci": "selvane-cloud"}, "repo": {"$ci": "org-guardrails"}, "title": {"$contains": "pol-selvane-cost-tag-v3"}}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"number": 208, "state": "open"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "github", "tool": "issue_write", "required": {"method": {"$ci": "create"}, "owner": {"$ci": "selvane-cloud"}, "repo": {"$ci": "org-guardrails"}, "title": {"$contains": "pol-selvane-cost-tag-v3"}}}]}
{"id": "tr-005", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "Search Terraform `data-sources` docs for `secret_ring` in provider `kelvar` under namespace `kelvar-ops`, fetch the Terraform provider details for the returned doc ID to find its required lookup argument name, and create a new Confluence page in space `SECENG` titled `Kelvar Secret Ring Lookup` whose content records that argument name.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "terraform", "tool": "search_provider_docs", "match": {"provider_name": {"$ci": "kelvar"}, "provider_namespace": {"$ci": "kelvar-ops"}, "service_slug": {"$ci": "secret_ring"}, "provider_document_type": {"$ci": "data-sources"}}, "result": {"json": {"documents": [{"provider_doc_id": "9418206", "title": "kelvar_secret_ring", "category": "data-sources"}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "terraform", "tool": "get_provider_details", "match": {"provider_doc_id": {"$ci": "9418206"}}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"provider_doc_id": "9418206", "required_argument": "keyring_slot_id", "description": "Reads a secret ring version by keyring_slot_id."}}}, {"id": "s3", "server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_create_page", "match": {"space_key": {"$ci": "SECENG"}, "title": {"$ci": "Kelvar Secret Ring Lookup"}, "content": {"$contains": "keyring_slot_id"}}, "after": ["s2"], "result": {"json": {"id": "84920163", "space_key": "SECENG", "title": "Kelvar Secret Ring Lookup"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2", "s3"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_create_page", "required": {"space_key": {"$ci": "SECENG"}, "title": {"$ci": "Kelvar Secret Ring Lookup"}, "content": {"$contains": "keyring_slot_id"}}}]}
{"id": "t-009", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "List `active` Grafana incidents to find the incident ID for the parquet sink outage, fetch that Grafana incident's details to get the stalled `job_batch_id`, update the matching documents in MongoDB on `conn-sched-04`, database `scheduler`, collection `jobs` (filtering on `job_batch_id`) by setting `status` to `cancelled`, and post a timeline note on the Grafana incident reporting the exact `modifiedCount` returned.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "grafana", "tool": "list_incidents", "match": {"status": {"$ci": "active"}}, "result": {"json": {"incidents": [{"id": "inc-7802", "title": "Parquet sink worker wedged", "status": "active", "severity": "major"}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "grafana", "tool": "get_incident", "match": {"id": {"$ci": "inc-7802"}}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"id": "inc-7802", "title": "Parquet sink worker wedged", "customFields": {"job_batch_id": "batch-9941-eu"}}}}, {"id": "s3", "server": "mongodb", "tool": "update-many", "match": {"connectionId": {"$ci": "conn-sched-04"}, "database": {"$ci": "scheduler"}, "collection": {"$ci": "jobs"}, "filter": {"$contains": "batch-9941-eu"}, "update": {"$contains": "cancelled"}}, "after": ["s2"], "result": {"json": {"matchedCount": 17, "modifiedCount": 17}}}, {"id": "s4", "server": "grafana", "tool": "add_activity_to_incident", "match": {"incidentId": {"$ci": "inc-7802"}, "body": {"$contains": "17"}}, "after": ["s3"], "result": {"json": {"id": "act-902", "incidentId": "inc-7802"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2", "s3", "s4"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "grafana", "tool": "add_activity_to_incident", "required": {"incidentId": {"$ci": "inc-7802"}, "body": {"$contains": "17"}}}]}
