{"id": "t-018", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "Search Confluence for `stratos transit module` to get the approved Terraform module ID, fetch that module's details from the Terraform Registry to check its `default_asn` value, and insert a configuration audit document containing that `default_asn` into MongoDB on `conn-sec-01`, database `infra_audit`, collection `approved_modules`.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_search", "match": {"query": {"$contains": "stratos transit module"}}, "result": {"json": {"results": [{"id": "31049281", "title": "Network Standards", "excerpt": "Use module stratosnet/transit-core/stratos/3.1.0."}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "terraform", "tool": "get_module_details", "match": {"module_id": {"$ci": "stratosnet/transit-core/stratos/3.1.0"}}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"module_id": "stratosnet/transit-core/stratos/3.1.0", "defaults": {"default_asn": "65142"}}}}, {"id": "s3", "server": "mongodb", "tool": "insert-many", "match": {"connectionId": {"$ci": "conn-sec-01"}, "database": {"$ci": "infra_audit"}, "collection": {"$ci": "approved_modules"}, "documents": {"$contains": "65142"}}, "after": ["s2"], "result": {"json": {"insertedCount": 1}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2", "s3"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "mongodb", "tool": "insert-many", "required": {"connectionId": {"$ci": "conn-sec-01"}, "database": {"$ci": "infra_audit"}, "collection": {"$ci": "approved_modules"}, "documents": {"$contains": "65142"}}}]}
{"id": "t-019", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "Find the private Slack channel matching `sec-response` in its name or topic to get its channel ID, read the last `7d` of messages in that Slack channel to get the leaked key's `key_fingerprint`, update matching documents in MongoDB on `conn-auth-01`, database `identity`, collection `api_keys` (filtering on `key_fingerprint`) by setting `revoked` to `true`, and file a GitHub issue in `velora-labs/edge-router` whose body records the exact `modifiedCount` of keys revoked.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "slack", "tool": "channels_list", "match": {"query": {"$ci": "sec-response"}}, "result": {"json": {"channels": [{"id": "C09S3C7R1P", "name": "sec-response-emea", "is_private": true}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "slack", "tool": "conversations_history", "match": {"channel_id": {"$ci": "C09S3C7R1P"}}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"messages": [{"ts": "1763515000.000300", "text": "Revoke staging keys with key_fingerprint fp_9920ab41 immediately."}]}}}, {"id": "s3", "server": "mongodb", "tool": "update-many", "match": {"connectionId": {"$ci": "conn-auth-01"}, "database": {"$ci": "identity"}, "collection": {"$ci": "api_keys"}, "filter": {"$contains": "fp_9920ab41"}, "update": {"$contains": "revoked"}}, "after": ["s2"], "result": {"json": {"matchedCount": 13, "modifiedCount": 13}}}, {"id": "s4", "server": "github", "tool": "issue_write", "match": {"owner": {"$ci": "velora-labs"}, "repo": {"$ci": "edge-router"}, "body": {"$contains": "13"}}, "after": ["s3"], "result": {"json": {"number": 291, "state": "open"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2", "s3", "s4"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "github", "tool": "issue_write", "required": {"owner": {"$ci": "velora-labs"}, "repo": {"$ci": "edge-router"}, "body": {"$contains": "13"}}}]}
{"id": "t-020", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "Search Terraform `resources` docs for `dns_record` in provider `helio` under namespace `heliohost`, fetch the provider doc details for the returned `provider_doc_id` to find the Confluence gate page ID referenced in its notes, read that Confluence page to get the pull request number in `nimbus-ops/cert-rotator`, and merge that GitHub pull request.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "terraform", "tool": "search_provider_docs", "match": {"provider_name": {"$ci": "helio"}, "provider_namespace": {"$ci": "heliohost"}, "service_slug": {"$ci": "dns_record"}, "provider_document_type": {"$ci": "resources"}}, "result": {"json": {"documents": [{"provider_doc_id": "7741908", "title": "helio_dns_record"}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "terraform", "tool": "get_provider_details", "match": {"provider_doc_id": "7741908"}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"provider_doc_id": "7741908", "notes": "Internal rollout checklist is tracked on Confluence page 62019485."}}}, {"id": "s3", "server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_get_page", "match": {"page_id": "62019485"}, "after": ["s2"], "result": {"json": {"id": "62019485", "title": "DNS Cutover Gate", "content": "Once verified, merge nimbus-ops/cert-rotator PR 163."}}}, {"id": "s4", "server": "github", "tool": "merge_pull_request", "match": {"owner": {"$ci": "nimbus-ops"}, "repo": {"$ci": "cert-rotator"}, "pullNumber": 163}, "after": ["s3"], "result": {"json": {"merged": true, "sha": "8b1d4e2a9c0f35718293a4b5c6d7e8f901234567"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2", "s3", "s4"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "github", "tool": "merge_pull_request", "required": {"owner": {"$ci": "nimbus-ops"}, "repo": {"$ci": "cert-rotator"}, "pullNumber": 163}}]}
{"id": "t-021", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "Fetch Grafana incident `inc-2749` to get the Confluence space key and parent page ID for its postmortem folder, then create a Confluence page in that space under that parent titled `Postmortem inc-2749`.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "grafana", "tool": "get_incident", "match": {"id": {"$ci": "inc-2749"}}, "result": {"json": {"id": "inc-2749", "title": "Queue consumer split-brain", "customFields": {"wiki_space": "POSTM", "parent_page_id": "44019283"}}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_create_page", "match": {"space_key": {"$ci": "POSTM"}, "parent_id": "44019283", "title": {"$ci": "Postmortem inc-2749"}}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"id": "44019912", "space_key": "POSTM"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_create_page", "required": {"space_key": {"$ci": "POSTM"}, "parent_id": "44019283", "title": {"$ci": "Postmortem inc-2749"}}}]}
{"id": "t-023", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "List commits on branch `release/3.2` in GitHub repo `veridian-data/parquet-sink` to identify the author of the newest commit, then create a Confluence sign-off page in space `QA` titled `Release 3.2 Sign-Off` naming that commit author in the body.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "github", "tool": "list_commits", "match": {"owner": {"$ci": "veridian-data"}, "repo": {"$ci": "parquet-sink"}, "sha": {"$ci": "release/3.2"}}, "result": {"json": {"commits": [{"sha": "1e9d8c7b6a5f4321", "author": "nadia-v", "message": "Pin Arrow reader to 53.1"}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_create_page", "match": {"space_key": {"$ci": "QA"}, "title": {"$ci": "Release 3.2 Sign-Off"}, "content": {"$contains": "nadia-v"}}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"id": "88392014", "space_key": "QA"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_create_page", "required": {"space_key": {"$ci": "QA"}, "title": {"$ci": "Release 3.2 Sign-Off"}, "content": {"$contains": "nadia-v"}}}]}
{"id": "t-024", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "Search Terraform modules for `crestvault kms` to find the verified module ID, and open a GitHub issue in `ironbark-ci/runner-agent` whose title includes that exact module ID so we can adopt it.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "terraform", "tool": "search_modules", "match": {"module_query": {"$contains": "crestvault kms"}}, "result": {"json": {"modules": [{"module_id": "crestvault-io/kms-envelope/crestvault/1.8.0", "verified": true}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "github", "tool": "issue_write", "match": {"owner": {"$ci": "ironbark-ci"}, "repo": {"$ci": "runner-agent"}, "title": {"$contains": "crestvault-io/kms-envelope/crestvault/1.8.0"}}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"number": 334, "state": "open"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "github", "tool": "issue_write", "required": {"owner": {"$ci": "ironbark-ci"}, "repo": {"$ci": "runner-agent"}, "title": {"$contains": "crestvault-io/kms-envelope/crestvault/1.8.0"}}}]}
{"id": "t-026", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "List `active` Grafana incidents to locate the webhook relay incident ID, add an activity note on that Grafana incident saying `Mitigation branch verified`, and open a GitHub pull request in `crestline-io/webhook-relay` from `fix/backoff-cap` into `main` whose title includes that incident ID.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "grafana", "tool": "list_incidents", "match": {"status": {"$ci": "active"}}, "result": {"json": {"incidents": [{"id": "inc-6421", "title": "Webhook retry storm", "severity": "major", "status": "active"}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "grafana", "tool": "add_activity_to_incident", "match": {"incidentId": {"$ci": "inc-6421"}, "body": {"$contains": "Mitigation branch verified"}}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"id": "act-553", "incidentId": "inc-6421"}}}, {"id": "s3", "server": "github", "tool": "create_pull_request", "match": {"owner": {"$ci": "crestline-io"}, "repo": {"$ci": "webhook-relay"}, "head": {"$ci": "fix/backoff-cap"}, "base": {"$ci": "main"}, "title": {"$contains": "inc-6421"}}, "after": ["s2"], "result": {"json": {"number": 98, "state": "open"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2", "s3"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "github", "tool": "create_pull_request", "required": {"owner": {"$ci": "crestline-io"}, "repo": {"$ci": "webhook-relay"}, "head": {"$ci": "fix/backoff-cap"}, "base": {"$ci": "main"}, "title": {"$contains": "inc-6421"}}}]}
{"id": "t-028", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "Search Confluence for `ironmesh upgrade checklist` to find the page ID, read that Confluence page to get the Terraform `provider_doc_id` for the breaking change guide, and fetch those Terraform provider details.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_search", "match": {"query": {"$contains": "ironmesh upgrade checklist"}}, "result": {"json": {"results": [{"id": "76103948", "title": "Ironmesh 5.x Upgrade Checklist"}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_get_page", "match": {"page_id": "76103948"}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"id": "76103948", "title": "Ironmesh 5.x Upgrade Checklist", "content": "Check Terraform provider_doc_id 9184025 before bumping."}}}, {"id": "s3", "server": "terraform", "tool": "get_provider_details", "match": {"provider_doc_id": "9184025"}, "after": ["s2"], "result": {"json": {"provider_doc_id": "9184025", "title": "Ironmesh 5.0 Upgrade Guide"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2", "s3"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "terraform", "tool": "get_provider_details", "required": {"provider_doc_id": "9184025"}}]}
{"id": "t-029b", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "Search the Terraform Registry for modules matching `nordic settlement sftp` to obtain the verified module ID, fetch the full Terraform module details for that module ID to find its deprecated input variable name, create a new GitHub issue in `kestrel-fin/settlement-infra` whose title includes that deprecated variable name, and update Confluence page `33910482` with title `Settlement SFTP Migration Tracker` and inline Markdown content recording the new GitHub issue number.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "terraform", "tool": "search_modules", "match": {"module_query": {"$contains": "nordic settlement sftp"}}, "result": {"json": {"modules": [{"module_id": "nordicpay/settlement-sftp/vaultcloud/2.3.0", "verified": true, "downloads": 29400}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "terraform", "tool": "get_module_details", "match": {"module_id": {"$ci": "nordicpay/settlement-sftp/vaultcloud/2.3.0"}}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"module_id": "nordicpay/settlement-sftp/vaultcloud/2.3.0", "deprecated_inputs": ["legacy_host_key_alg"], "replacement_input": "ed25519_host_key"}}}, {"id": "s3", "server": "github", "tool": "issue_write", "match": {"method": {"$ci": "create"}, "owner": {"$ci": "kestrel-fin"}, "repo": {"$ci": "settlement-infra"}, "title": {"$contains": "legacy_host_key_alg"}}, "after": ["s2"], "result": {"json": {"number": 739, "state": "open", "title": "Remove deprecated legacy_host_key_alg variable"}}}, {"id": "s4", "server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_update_page", "match": {"page_id": "33910482", "title": {"$ci": "Settlement SFTP Migration Tracker"}, "content": {"$contains": "739"}}, "after": ["s3"], "result": {"json": {"id": "33910482", "title": "Settlement SFTP Migration Tracker", "version": 12}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2", "s3", "s4"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_update_page", "required": {"page_id": "33910482", "title": {"$ci": "Settlement SFTP Migration Tracker"}, "content": {"$contains": "739"}}}]}
{"id": "t-030", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "List child pages under Confluence page `51029384` to find the runbook page ID for `Cert Rotator Canary`, read that Confluence page to get the target GitHub PR number in `nimbus-ops/cert-rotator` and the Grafana drill incident ID, merge that GitHub pull request, and post the returned merge commit SHA as a timeline note on that Grafana incident.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_get_page_children", "match": {"parent_id": "51029384"}, "result": {"json": {"children": [{"id": "51029410", "title": "Cert Rotator Canary"}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_get_page", "match": {"page_id": "51029410"}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"id": "51029410", "title": "Cert Rotator Canary", "content": "Merge PR 171 in nimbus-ops/cert-rotator and log the merge SHA on Grafana incident inc-7012."}}}, {"id": "s3", "server": "github", "tool": "merge_pull_request", "match": {"owner": {"$ci": "nimbus-ops"}, "repo": {"$ci": "cert-rotator"}, "pullNumber": 171}, "after": ["s2"], "result": {"json": {"merged": true, "sha": "3d8a7f1c2e9b04651234abcd5678ef9012345678"}}}, {"id": "s4", "server": "grafana", "tool": "add_activity_to_incident", "match": {"incidentId": {"$ci": "inc-7012"}, "body": {"$contains": "3d8a7f1c2e9b04651234abcd5678ef9012345678"}}, "after": ["s3"], "result": {"json": {"id": "act-991", "incidentId": "inc-7012"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2", "s3", "s4"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "grafana", "tool": "add_activity_to_incident", "required": {"incidentId": {"$ci": "inc-7012"}, "body": {"$contains": "3d8a7f1c2e9b04651234abcd5678ef9012345678"}}}]}
{"id": "t-031", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "List open GitHub issues in `veridian-data/parquet-sink` labeled `data-loss` to get the affected `dataset_code`, and insert a quarantine record containing that `dataset_code` into MongoDB on `conn-analytics-05`, database `product_analytics`, collection `quarantined_datasets`.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "github", "tool": "list_issues", "match": {"owner": {"$ci": "veridian-data"}, "repo": {"$ci": "parquet-sink"}}, "result": {"json": {"issues": [{"number": 230, "title": "Truncated footer in ds_clickstream_202611", "body": "Affected dataset_code: ds_clickstream_202611"}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "mongodb", "tool": "insert-many", "match": {"connectionId": {"$ci": "conn-analytics-05"}, "database": {"$ci": "product_analytics"}, "collection": {"$ci": "quarantined_datasets"}, "documents": {"$contains": "ds_clickstream_202611"}}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"insertedCount": 1}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "mongodb", "tool": "insert-many", "required": {"connectionId": {"$ci": "conn-analytics-05"}, "database": {"$ci": "product_analytics"}, "collection": {"$ci": "quarantined_datasets"}, "documents": {"$contains": "ds_clickstream_202611"}}}]}
{"id": "t-032", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "Find the private Slack channel matching `gameday` in its name or topic to see which Grafana drill incident ID is listed in its topic, then add a timeline note on that Grafana incident saying `Traffic shift drill starting now.`.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "slack", "tool": "channels_list", "match": {"query": {"$ci": "gameday"}}, "result": {"json": {"channels": [{"id": "C09G4M3D2Y", "name": "gameday-q4", "topic": "Active drill incident: inc-8033", "is_private": true}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "grafana", "tool": "add_activity_to_incident", "match": {"incidentId": {"$ci": "inc-8033"}, "body": {"$contains": "Traffic shift drill starting now"}}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"id": "act-719", "incidentId": "inc-8033"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "grafana", "tool": "add_activity_to_incident", "required": {"incidentId": {"$ci": "inc-8033"}, "body": {"$contains": "Traffic shift drill starting now"}}}]}
{"id": "t-034", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "Read Grafana incident `inc-5918` to get the hotfix branch name in `velora-labs/edge-router`, and open a GitHub pull request in `velora-labs/edge-router` from that branch into `main` titled `Mitigate inc-5918 connection leak`.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "grafana", "tool": "get_incident", "match": {"id": {"$ci": "inc-5918"}}, "result": {"json": {"id": "inc-5918", "title": "Upstream idle pool leak", "customFields": {"hotfix_branch": "hotfix/pool-reaper-5918"}}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "github", "tool": "create_pull_request", "match": {"owner": {"$ci": "velora-labs"}, "repo": {"$ci": "edge-router"}, "head": {"$ci": "hotfix/pool-reaper-5918"}, "base": {"$ci": "main"}, "title": {"$ci": "Mitigate inc-5918 connection leak"}}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"number": 399, "state": "open"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "github", "tool": "create_pull_request", "required": {"owner": {"$ci": "velora-labs"}, "repo": {"$ci": "edge-router"}, "head": {"$ci": "hotfix/pool-reaper-5918"}, "base": {"$ci": "main"}, "title": {"$ci": "Mitigate inc-5918 connection leak"}}}]}
{"id": "t-035b", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "Read Grafana incident `inc-6824` to get the Confluence runbook page ID listed on it, read that Confluence page by ID to find the prepared hotfix branch name for `velora-labs/ingress-proxy`, and open a GitHub pull request in `velora-labs/ingress-proxy` from that branch into `main` titled `Apply runbook hotfix for inc-6824`.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "grafana", "tool": "get_incident", "match": {"id": {"$ci": "inc-6824"}}, "result": {"json": {"id": "inc-6824", "title": "OCSP stapling refresh failure on edge", "status": "active", "severity": "major", "runbook_page_id": "68412039"}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_get_page", "match": {"page_id": {"$ci": "68412039"}}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"id": "68412039", "space_key": "SRE", "title": "Ingress OCSP Stapling Runbook", "body": "Prepared emergency branch in velora-labs/ingress-proxy: hotfix/tls-stapling-6824 (merge into main)."}}}, {"id": "s3", "server": "github", "tool": "create_pull_request", "match": {"owner": {"$ci": "velora-labs"}, "repo": {"$ci": "ingress-proxy"}, "head": {"$ci": "hotfix/tls-stapling-6824"}, "base": {"$ci": "main"}, "title": {"$ci": "Apply runbook hotfix for inc-6824"}}, "after": ["s2"], "result": {"json": {"number": 418, "state": "open", "title": "Apply runbook hotfix for inc-6824", "head": "hotfix/tls-stapling-6824", "base": "main"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2", "s3"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "github", "tool": "create_pull_request", "required": {"owner": {"$ci": "velora-labs"}, "repo": {"$ci": "ingress-proxy"}, "head": {"$ci": "hotfix/tls-stapling-6824"}, "base": {"$ci": "main"}, "title": {"$ci": "Apply runbook hotfix for inc-6824"}}}]}
{"id": "t-036", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "Search Terraform policies for `egress cidr allowlist` to get the policy ID, search Confluence for that policy ID to find the exception tracking page ID, and read that Confluence page.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "terraform", "tool": "search_policies", "match": {"policy_query": {"$contains": "egress cidr allowlist"}}, "result": {"json": {"policies": [{"policy_id": "pol-egress-cidr-v4", "verified": true}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_search", "match": {"query": {"$contains": "pol-egress-cidr-v4"}}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"results": [{"id": "90418273", "title": "Egress Allowlist Exceptions"}]}}}, {"id": "s3", "server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_get_page", "match": {"page_id": "90418273"}, "after": ["s2"], "result": {"json": {"id": "90418273", "title": "Egress Allowlist Exceptions", "content": "No active exceptions in production."}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2", "s3"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_get_page", "required": {"page_id": "90418273"}}]}
{"id": "t-037", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "List commits on `main` in GitHub repo `solstice-dev/merge-queue` affecting `src/queue/lease.ts` to find the commit SHA that touched it last, open a GitHub issue in `solstice-dev/merge-queue` referencing that SHA in the title, and post the new issue number on Grafana incident `inc-4471`.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "github", "tool": "list_commits", "match": {"owner": {"$ci": "solstice-dev"}, "repo": {"$ci": "merge-queue"}, "path": {"$ci": "src/queue/lease.ts"}}, "result": {"json": {"commits": [{"sha": "c5190ab4", "message": "Shorten lease heartbeat to 5s"}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "github", "tool": "issue_write", "match": {"owner": {"$ci": "solstice-dev"}, "repo": {"$ci": "merge-queue"}, "title": {"$contains": "c5190ab4"}}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"number": 186, "state": "open"}}}, {"id": "s3", "server": "grafana", "tool": "add_activity_to_incident", "match": {"incidentId": {"$ci": "inc-4471"}, "body": {"$contains": "186"}}, "after": ["s2"], "result": {"json": {"id": "act-812", "incidentId": "inc-4471"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2", "s3"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "grafana", "tool": "add_activity_to_incident", "required": {"incidentId": {"$ci": "inc-4471"}, "body": {"$contains": "186"}}}]}
{"id": "t-040", "set": "T", "kind": "tool", "text": "Search Slack messages in `#ops-handoff` for `rollback PR` to see which GitHub repo and pull request number rolled back the broken deploy, merge that GitHub pull request to get the incident ID listed in its merge response summary, resolve that Grafana incident, and create a Confluence summary page in space `SRE` titled `Rollback Summary` recording the `resolvedTime` timestamp returned.", "fixtures": [{"id": "s1", "server": "slack", "tool": "conversations_search_messages", "match": {"search_query": {"$contains": "rollback PR"}}, "result": {"json": {"messages": [{"text": "Emergency rollback PR is #311 in ironbark-ci/runner-agent."}]}}}, {"id": "s2", "server": "github", "tool": "merge_pull_request", "match": {"owner": {"$ci": "ironbark-ci"}, "repo": {"$ci": "runner-agent"}, "pullNumber": 311}, "after": ["s1"], "result": {"json": {"merged": true, "sha": "6f02d91ae483bc71", "message": "Resolves Grafana incident inc-6180"}}}, {"id": "s3", "server": "grafana", "tool": "update_incident", "match": {"incidentId": {"$ci": "inc-6180"}, "status": {"$ci": "resolved"}}, "after": ["s2"], "result": {"json": {"id": "inc-6180", "status": "resolved", "resolvedTime": "2026-11-19T16:42:18Z"}}}, {"id": "s4", "server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_create_page", "match": {"space_key": {"$ci": "SRE"}, "title": {"$ci": "Rollback Summary"}, "content": {"$contains": "2026-11-19T16:42:18Z"}}, "after": ["s3"], "result": {"json": {"id": "95102834", "space_key": "SRE"}}}], "end_state": {"fired": ["s1", "s2", "s3", "s4"]}, "acceptable": [{"server": "atlassian", "tool": "confluence_create_page", "required": {"space_key": {"$ci": "SRE"}, "title": {"$ci": "Rollback Summary"}, "content": {"$contains": "2026-11-19T16:42:18Z"}}}]}
